sequenceDiagram
    actor Maya
    participant O as CMP-003 Orchestrator
    participant I as CMP-007 Authority
    participant A as AGT-001
    participant V as Candidate verifier endpoint
    participant S as Immutable artifact store

    Maya->>O: Continue CASE-001
    O->>A: Execute bounded verification work unit
    A->>O: Proposed handoff request (no authority)
    O->>I: Request child grant bound to case/run/task/audience
    I-->>O: DATA-093 attenuated one-use grant
    O->>O: Build and sign DATA-092 task envelope
    O->>V: Offer task (sandbox-only, sequential)
    V->>I: Verify grant, audience, expiry, nonce and scope
    V->>S: Load immutable DATA-095 artefact after authorization
    V-->>O: Signed DATA-094 acceptance receipt
    O->>V: Mark accepted then running
    V->>V: Deterministic verification fixture
    V->>S: Persist immutable DATA-096 result artefact
    V-->>O: Completed status + signed receipt + result reference
    O->>I: Exhaust/revoke child grant
    O->>O: Validate all terminal / artefacts verified
    O-->>Maya: Preliminary verification evidence; not approval or final closure
